        <article class="blog-card">
          <div class="blog-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe 0%, #00f2fe 100%);"></div>
          <div class="blog-content">
            <div class="blog-meta">
              <span class="blog-date">April 8, 2024</span>
              <span class="blog-category">Cloud</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Cloud Migration Guide</h3>
            <p>A comprehensive guide to successfully migrating your infrastructure to the cloud with minimal disruption.</p>
            <a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="blog-card">
          <div class="blog-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fa709a 0%, #fee140 100%);"></div>
          <div class="blog-content">
            <div class="blog-meta">
              <span class="blog-date">April 5, 2024</span>
              <span class="blog-category">AI</span>
            </div>
            <h3>AI Integration in Business Apps</h3>
            <p>How artificial intelligence is revolutionizing business applications and improving decision-making processes.</p>
            <a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="blog-card">
          <div class="blog-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a8edea 0%, #fed6e3 100%);"></div>
          <div class="blog-content">
            <div class="blog-meta">
              <span class="blog-date">April 2, 2024</span>
              <span class="blog-category">DevOps</span>
            </div>
            <h3>CI/CD Pipeline Optimization</h3>
            <p>Streamlining your development workflow with efficient continuous integration and deployment strategies.</p>
            <a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="blog-card">
          <div class="blog-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9566 0%, #ff6b6b 100%);"></div>
          <div class="blog-content">
            <div class="blog-meta">
              <span class="blog-date">March 30, 2024</span>
              <span class="blog-category">Performance</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Web Performance Optimization</h3>
            <p>Techniques to improve your website's speed and performance for better user experience and SEO.</p>
            <a href="#" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
          </div>
        </article>
